<% layout('/layouts/boilerplate') -%>

<div class="row mt-4 mb-5">
  <div class="col-12 col-md-10 offset-md-1 col-lg-8 offset-lg-2">
    <div class="card shadow-sm border p-4 p-md-5">
      <div class="d-flex align-items-center mb-4">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved fa-2x text-danger me-3"></i>
        <div>
          <h2 class="mb-0 fw-bold">Privacy Policy</h2>
          <small class="text-muted">Last updated: November 2026</small>
        </div>
      </div>
      <hr>

      <section class="mb-4">
        <h4>1. Information We Collect</h4>
        <p class="text-muted">
          At Wanderlust, we collect information you provide directly to us when creating an account, publishing a listing, reserving a trip, or writing a review. This includes:
        </p>
        <ul class="text-muted">
          <li><strong>Personal Details:</strong> Name, username, email address, and profile credentials.</li>
          <li><strong>Listing Information:</strong> Titles, descriptions, photos, prices, geographic coordinates, and location data.</li>
          <li><strong>Booking Data:</strong> Check-in and check-out dates, guest count, and total costs.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-4">
        <h4>2. How We Use Your Information</h4>
        <p class="text-muted">
          We use your data solely to deliver, secure, and enhance our services, including:
        </p>
        <ul class="text-muted">
          <li>Processing reservations, trip bookings, and communications between hosts and guests.</li>
          <li>Generating accurate Mapbox geolocation markers for travel directions.</li>
          <li>Preventing double-booking and securing your account with encrypted authentication.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-4">
        <h4>3. Information Sharing</h4>
        <p class="text-muted">
          We do not sell or rent your personal information to third parties. Information is only shared with:
        </p>
        <ul class="text-muted">
          <li><strong>Hosts & Guests:</strong> Limited booking details are provided to hosts to prepare for your stay.</li>
          <li><strong>Service Providers:</strong> Cloud storage (Cloudinary) for images and Mapbox for map tiles.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-4">
        <h4>4. Your Rights & Security</h4>
        <p class="text-muted">
          You have the right to edit your listings, cancel your bookings, or delete your account at any time. We apply industry-standard encryption, password hashing with PBKDF2 salting, and secure cookies to protect your personal data.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h4>5. Contact Us</h4>
        <p class="text-muted mb-0">
          Have questions regarding our Privacy Policy? Reach out to our privacy team at <a href="mailto:privacy@wanderlust.com" class="text-decoration-none text-danger fw-semibold">privacy@wanderlust.com</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
